*supabase/**

# Sisyphus orchestration artifacts (planning docs, local agent state)
.sisyphus/

# Local GitLab Runner state (do not commit)
.gitlab/gitlab-runner/**
# Tracked on purpose: setup docs and compose file, not runner state.
# NOTE the ** — a trailing-slash directory rule cannot be negated into.
!.gitlab/gitlab-runner/README.md
!.gitlab/gitlab-runner/docker-compose.yml

# Mypy report artifact
index.txt
.omo/**
.worktrees/**
.codegraph/
.build/
.wrangler/

# CHAOS-3462: the Wave 4 corpus launcher's JUnit report. Its SIBLINGS in that
# directory -- the wave4_case_result.v1 receipts -- are deliberately tracked
# evidence, so the directory itself must stay un-ignored; only this per-run
# byproduct is excluded, so `run_wave4_corpus.sh` leaves no untracked noise
# that could be swept into a commit.
tests/acceptance/artifacts/wave4/junit-corpus.xml

# CHAOS-3219 Phase 5: the acceptance CI lane's tee'd boot/corpus/stack logs.
# .github/workflows/ask-dev-acceptance.yml writes them here and uploads them as
# a run artifact; a local reproduction of that same sequence writes them here
# too. Per-run byproducts, never commit content.
.acceptance-logs/

# Agent tool scratch output (browser automation, session memory). These are
# per-run artifacts and must never enter a commit.
.playwright-mcp/
.remember/

# Local dev/CI-parity byproducts (CHAOS-3403). `uv sync --all-extras --dev` (the
# documented worktree setup step) leaves untracked interpreter binaries/symlinks
# under .venv/bin/ (python, pip, pip3, pip3.12, activate*, Activate.ps1,
# pyvenv.cfg); a `git add -A` in that state commits interpreter symlinks into a PR
# (caught only by manual inspection during CHAOS-3401). ci/local_validate.sh's
# lint/typecheck stages likewise leave .mypy_cache/ and .ruff_cache/ untracked —
# same class of local-run byproduct, same accidental-commit risk under `git add -A`.
.venv/
.venv
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
# Per-worktree uv cache (CHAOS-4411) — UV_CACHE_DIR points here so concurrent
# `uv sync` runs in different worktrees don't serialize on ~/.cache/uv/.lock.
.uv-cache/
worktrees/
# Anchored: a bare name also matches the directory cmd/dev-health-workerctl/,
# which hid its three tracked Go sources from every gitignore-aware tool.
/dev-health-workerctl
